---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';import {campgrounds} from '../lib/content';const camps=await campgrounds();
---
<Base title="Photo credits and licenses"><div class="container"><div class="page-intro"><h1>Photo credits and licenses</h1><p>Park landscape images are sourced from Wikimedia Commons under the licenses below. They are not original trip photographs and do not show a verified individual campsite. Files may be resized and cropped in the page layout. Original field-note illustrations are created for this publication.</p></div><div class="prose section photo-credits"><section><h2>Camping banner photographs</h2><p>Home page: <a href="https://unsplash.com/photos/tent-set-up-by-a-lake-with-pine-trees-OHi9hrdC7N0">Tent set up by a lake with pine trees</a> by <a href="https://unsplash.com/@potokvarte">Hanna Lazar</a>.</p><p>Campground directory: <a href="https://unsplash.com/photos/three-tents-set-up-on-a-grassy-lakeside-3lbaVlu4P5E">Three tents set up on a grassy lakeside</a> by <a href="https://unsplash.com/@adempercem">Adem Percem</a>.</p><p>Both photographs are used under the <a href="https://unsplash.com/license">Unsplash License</a>, verified October 27, 2026. Resized, converted to WebP and cropped by the layout. These are general camping inspiration photographs; their locations are not represented as Wisconsin or as a campground in this directory. They are not our firsthand trip photographs. No AI-generated banner images are used.</p></section>{camps.filter(c=>c.data.image).map(c=><section><h2>{c.data.name}</h2><p>{c.data.image!.caption}</p><p>{c.data.image!.author} · <a href={c.data.image!.licenseUrl}>{c.data.image!.license}</a> · <a href={c.data.image!.file}>Original file and full attribution</a>. {c.data.image!.modified}</p></section>)}</div></div></Base>
